sequenceDiagram
    participant Host as Host Process<br/>(Praxis Proxy)
    participant Engine as PPE PolicyEngine
    participant Identity as Identity Plugin<br/>(JWT / API-Key)
    participant IdP as IdP JWKS Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PDP as PDP Plugin<br/>(Cedar / CEL / OPA)
    participant Delegation as Delegation Plugin<br/>(OAuth / CIBA)
    participant IdPToken as IdP Token Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Session as Valkey Session Store<br/>6379/TCP Redis
    participant EffectLog as Effect Log<br/>(local fs, fsync)
    participant AuditSink as Audit Sink Plugins

    Note over Host,AuditSink: Flow 1: Policy Evaluation Pipeline

    Host->>Engine: evaluate(request_context)<br/>In-process function call
    activate Engine

    rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
        Note over Engine,IdP: Phase 1: Sequential (blocking)
        Engine->>Identity: identity.resolve hook
        Identity->>IdP: GET /.well-known/jwks.json<br/>TLS 1.2+ (rustls/ring)
        IdP-->>Identity: JWKS keys
        Identity-->>Engine: Verified identity<br/>(subject, client, caller_workload)
    end

    rect rgb(213, 232, 212)
        Note over Engine,PDP: Phase 2: Transform (non-blocking)
        Engine->>PDP: policy.evaluate<br/>In-process call
        PDP-->>Engine: Allow / Deny decision
    end

    rect rgb(255, 242, 204)
        Note over Engine,AuditSink: Phase 3: Audit (non-blocking)
        Engine->>EffectLog: Write effect record<br/>fsync before act
        Engine->>AuditSink: Decision audit callback<br/>(HMAC-SHA256 provenance)
    end

    rect rgb(218, 232, 252)
        Note over Engine,Session: Phase 4: Concurrent (blocking)
        Engine->>Delegation: delegation.exchange
        Delegation->>IdPToken: POST /token<br/>RFC 8693 exchange<br/>TLS 1.2+ (rustls/ring)
        IdPToken-->>Delegation: Delegated token
        Delegation-->>Engine: Delegated credential
        Engine->>Session: Store taint labels<br/>Optional TLS (rustls)
        Session-->>Engine: Ack
    end

    rect rgb(248, 206, 204)
        Note over Engine,AuditSink: Phase 5: Fire-and-Forget (after verdict)
        Engine->>AuditSink: Post-verdict audit<br/>(runs after response returned)
    end

    Engine-->>Host: Verdict + Effects
    deactivate Engine

    Note over Host,AuditSink: Flow 3: Secret Resolution (at startup)

    Host->>Engine: initialize(config)
    activate Engine
    Engine->>Engine: Read file / env secrets
    Engine->>Engine: Vault KV v2 fetch<br/>8200/TCP HTTPS<br/>K8s SA / AppRole auth
    Engine-->>Host: Engine ready
    deactivate Engine
